{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Net Raiders</strong> is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder RPG set in a crumbling virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge cards in real time, build powerful combos, and uncover the secrets hidden behind every corrupted node. Will you be the one to restore order?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Merge System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/d016fe6547cde4910dbec0499e29261e.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/d016fe6547cde4910dbec0499e29261e.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/d016fe6547cde4910dbec0499e29261e.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge two identical cards in your hand to unleash one of three effects:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6c0334518c3933dc7da684cb04d9a14c.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=392 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6c0334518c3933dc7da684cb04d9a14c.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/6c0334518c3933dc7da684cb04d9a14c.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhance Merge</strong> \u2013 Upgrade or change a card's ability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/3d74c3685f1f3d55e6916c089beaa2b7.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=616 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/3d74c3685f1f3d55e6916c089beaa2b7.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/3d74c3685f1f3d55e6916c089beaa2b7.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply Merge</strong> \u2013 Draw a new card from the merged position </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/cad06a177cacce005e7ca60d13c42604.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=444 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/cad06a177cacce005e7ca60d13c42604.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/cad06a177cacce005e7ca60d13c42604.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform Merge</strong> \u2013 Convert into another card from your hand </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Strategic Conditions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/a736bc2914cf59a8d8377531134f5ccb.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/a736bc2914cf59a8d8377531134f5ccb.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/a736bc2914cf59a8d8377531134f5ccb.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/f654198c025335c0e96d9aee8aa1f7ec.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=552 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/f654198c025335c0e96d9aee8aa1f7ec.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/f654198c025335c0e96d9aee8aa1f7ec.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cards trigger powerful effects if specific conditions are met.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your deck carefully and master these conditional mechanics to gain the upper hand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique Characters, Unique Decks</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bdbfbac2726a7b3acaf66d4d83e8426b.poster.avif?t=1756356832\" width=618 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bdbfbac2726a7b3acaf66d4d83e8426b.webm?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/extras/bdbfbac2726a7b3acaf66d4d83e8426b.mp4?t=1756356832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playable character features their own distinct cards and playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your build using unique chips, cards, and items that complement your strategy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Run is a New Challenge</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face unpredictable enemies, random events, and ever-changing card pools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two runs are the same\u2014adapt, experiment, and evolve with every playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact - <a href=\"mailto:obliqoninc@gmail.com\">obliqoninc@gmail.com</a></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1756356832","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2520780?t=1756356832","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756356832","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2520780/cde6632f58bc79bb7980062491c721820becaa16/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756356832","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2524430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merge cards. Outsmart threats. Survive the collapse.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Net Raiders</strong> is a single-player roguelike deckbuilder RPG set in a crumbling virtual world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge cards in real time, build powerful combos, and uncover the secrets hidden behind every corrupted node. Will you be the one to restore order?  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"